q2: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ fseq u ⊆ fseq (trees l) $ by fseq_mono [q1]
