q4: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees l) $ by subset_elim [q2, q3]
