q8: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ {y | y ∊ P} ⊆ P $ by t1_cab_welc_subset
q9: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ crn j ⊆ P $ by subset_trans [q7, q8]
q10: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ ∀ k ∀ s (k ∊ l → s ∊ fseq (trees l) → crn s ⊆ P → ⟨ k , s ⟩ ∈ P) $ by weaken [#1]
q11: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ ∀ s (i ∊ l → s ∊ fseq (trees l) → crn s ⊆ P → ⟨ i , s ⟩ ∈ P) $ by all_elim (t := $ i $) [q10]
q12: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ i ∊ l → j ∊ fseq (trees l) → crn j ⊆ P → ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ P $ by all_elim (t := $ j $) [q11]
q13: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ i ∊ l $ by ax
q14: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees l) → crn j ⊆ P → ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q12, q13]
q15: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ crn j ⊆ P → ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q14, q4]
q16: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ P $ by imp_elim [q15, q9]
q17: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by ax
q18: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [q17]
