q20: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ z ∊ P $ by wcel_welc [q19]
q21: $ G , w = ω , u ⊆ trees l , u ⊆ {y | y ∊ P} , z = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , i ∊ l , j ∊ fseq u ⇒ z ∊ {y | y ∊ P} $ by cab_intro (x := $ y $, t := $ z $, p := $ y ∊ P $) [q20]
