m11: $ G , w = ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ {z | ∃ i ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ i ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H))} $ by cab_intro (x := $ z $, t := $ w $, p := $ ∃ i ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ i ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $) [m10]
m12: $ G , w = ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w ∊ tstep L F H $ by weaken [m11]
m13: $ G , w = ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tstep L F H $ by wcel_intro [m4, m12]
m14: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tstep L F H $ by isset_elim [m3, m13]

tstep_elim
----------
l1: $ G ⇒ z ∊ {w | ∃ k ∃ s (w = ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ s ∊ fseq (cdm H))} $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ k ∃ s (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ s ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by cab_elim (x := $ w $, t := $ z $, p := $ ∃ k ∃ s (w = ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ s ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $) [l1]

lemma t2_opair_fst (G: hyps) (a b: set) (C D: class): $ G ⇒ isset C $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ C , D ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ a = C $
----
f0: $ G ⇒ isset a $ by isset_var
f1: $ G ⇒ isset (csn a) $ by csn_set [f0]
f2: $ G ⇒ cpr (csn a) (cpr a b) = cpr (csn C) (cpr C D) $ by weaken [#2]
f3: $ G ⇒ csn a = csn C ∨ csn a = cpr C D $ by cpr_eq_elim_l [f2, f1]
f4: $ G , csn a = csn C ⇒ a ∊ csn a $ by csn_intro_var
f5: $ G , csn a = csn C ⇒ csn a = csn C $ by ax
f6: $ G , csn a = csn C ⇒ a ∊ csn C $ by welc_eq [f5, f4]
f7: $ G , csn a = csn C ⇒ a = C $ by csn_elim [f6]
f8: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ c = C $ by ax
f9: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ c = C ∨ c = D $ by or_intro_l [f8]
f10: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ c ∊ cpr C D $ by cpr_intro [f9]
f11: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ csn a = cpr C D $ by ax
f12: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ cpr C D = csn a $ by eq_sym [f11]
f13: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ c ∊ csn a $ by welc_eq [f12, f10]
f14: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ c = a $ by csn_elim [f13]
f15: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ a = c $ by eq_sym [f14]
f16: $ G , csn a = cpr C D , c = C ⇒ a = C $ by eq_trans [f15, f8]
f17: $ G , csn a = cpr C D ⇒ a = C $ by isset_elim [#1, f16]
f18: $ G ⇒ a = C $ by or_elim [f3, f7, f17]

--| A member of `tstep` with first component `a`: `a` is a node.
lemma t2_tstep_fst (G: hyps) (L F H: class) (a b: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ tstep L F H $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $
----
f1: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ w ∊ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
f2: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by tstep_elim [f1]
g1: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
g2: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [g1]
g3: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by and_elim_r [g1]
g4: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ u ∊ L $ by and_elim_l [g3]
g5: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by and_elim_r [g3]
g6: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by ax
g7: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [g6]
g8: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [g7, g2]
g9: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ isset ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by opair_isset
g10: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by t2_opair_fst [g9, g8]
g11: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by cxp_intro_eq [g10, g4, g5]
g12: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by ax
g13: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by ex_elim [g12, g11]
g14: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by ex_elim [f2, g13]
g15: $ G ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by wcel_elim [#1, g14]

--| A member of `tstep` is determined by its first component.
lemma t2_tstep_snd (G: hyps) (L F H: class) (a b i j: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ tstep L F H $ > $ G ⇒ a = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $
----
f1: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ w ∊ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
f2: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by tstep_elim [f1]
h1: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
h2: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [h1]
h2a: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by ax
h2b: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [h2a]
h3: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [h2b, h2]
h3b: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ isset ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by opair_isset
h4: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by t2_opair_fst [h3b, h3]
h5: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by weaken [#2]
h6: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ = a $ by eq_sym [h4]
h7: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ u , v ⟩ = ⟨ i , j ⟩ $ by eq_trans [h6, h5]
h8: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ u = i $ by opair_inj_l [h7]
h9: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ v = j $ by opair_inj_r [h7]
h10: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ H = H $ by eq_refl
h11: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ccom H v = ccom H j $ by ccom_eq [h10, h9]
h12: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ = ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h9, h11]
h13: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h8, h12]
h14: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ F = F $ by eq_refl
h15: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ = fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [h14, h13]
h17: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [h7, h15]
h18: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [h3, h17]
h19: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by ax
h20: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ v (w = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ u ∊ L ∧ v ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ex_elim [h19, h18]
h21: $ G , w = ⟨ a , b ⟩ , w ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ex_elim [f2, h20]
h22: $ G ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ i , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ i , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by wcel_elim [#1, h21]

tstep_functional
----------------
n1: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
n3: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ x ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by t2_tstep_fst [n1]
n4: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by ax
n5: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
n6: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
n7: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by t2_tstep_snd [n5, n4]
n8: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ x , z ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by t2_tstep_snd [n6, n4]
n9: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , fv F ⟨ u , ⟨ v , ccom H v ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ x , z ⟩ $ by eq_sym [n8]
n10: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ = ⟨ x , z ⟩ $ by eq_trans [n7, n9]
n11: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , x = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ L , v ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ y = z $ by opair_inj_r [n10]
n12: $ G , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , z ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ y = z $ by cxp_elim [n3, n11]
n13: $ G ⇒ functional (tstep L F H) $ by functional_intro [n12]

lemma t2_cpr_proper (G: hyps) (A D: class): $ G ⇒ ¬ isset D $ > $ G ⇒ cpr A D = csn A $
----
c5: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D ⇒ w ∊ cpr A D $ by ax
c6: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D ⇒ w = A ∨ w = D $ by cpr_elim [c5]
c7: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = A ⇒ w = A $ by ax
c8: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = A ⇒ w ∊ csn A $ by csn_intro [c7]
c9: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = D ⇒ w = D $ by ax
c10: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = D ⇒ isset D $ by isset_intro [c9]
c11: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = D ⇒ ¬ isset D $ by weaken [#1]
c12: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = D ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [c11, c10]
c13: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D , w = D ⇒ w ∊ csn A $ by bot_elim [c12]
c14: $ G , w ∊ cpr A D ⇒ w ∊ csn A $ by or_elim [c6, c8, c13]
d1: $ G , w ∊ csn A ⇒ w ∊ csn A $ by ax
d2: $ G , w ∊ csn A ⇒ w = A $ by csn_elim [d1]
d3: $ G , w ∊ csn A ⇒ w = A ∨ w = D $ by or_intro_l [d2]
d4: $ G , w ∊ csn A ⇒ w ∊ cpr A D $ by cpr_intro [d3]
d5: $ G ⇒ cpr A D = csn A $ by eq_intro [c14, d4]

--| A pair with a set as its first component is a pair of sets.
lemma t2_opair_ex {x y: set} (G: hyps) (c: set) (A D: class): $ G ⇒ isset A $ > $ G ⇒ c = ⟨ A , D ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $
----
e1: $ G ⇒ isset D ∨ ¬ isset D $ by excluded_middle
e2: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ u = A $ by ax
e3: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ v = D $ by ax
e4: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ A = u $ by eq_sym [e2]
e5: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ D = v $ by eq_sym [e3]
e6: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ ⟨ A , D ⟩ = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by opair_eq [e4, e5]
e7: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ c = ⟨ A , D ⟩ $ by weaken [#2]
e8: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ c = ⟨ u , v ⟩ $ by eq_trans [e7, e6]
e9: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ ∃ y (c = ⟨ u , y ⟩) $ by ex_intro (x := $ y $, t := $ v $, p := $ c = ⟨ u , y ⟩ $) [e8]
e10: $ G , isset D , u = A , v = D ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by ex_intro (x := $ x $, t := $ u $, p := $ ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $) [e9]
e11: $ G , isset D , u = A ⇒ isset D $ by ax
e12: $ G , isset D , u = A ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by isset_elim [e11, e10]
e13: $ G , isset D ⇒ isset A $ by weaken [#1]
e14: $ G , isset D ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by isset_elim [e13, e12]
e15a: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ ¬ isset D $ by ax
e15: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ cpr u D = csn u $ by t2_cpr_proper [e15a]
e16a: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ csn u = csn u $ by eq_refl
e16b: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ cpr (csn u) (cpr u D) = cpr (csn u) (csn u) $ by cpr_eq [e16a, e15]
e16: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ ⟨ u , D ⟩ = ⟨ u , u ⟩ $ by weaken [e16b]
e17a: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ u = A $ by ax
e17b: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ A = u $ by eq_sym [e17a]
e17c: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ D = D $ by eq_refl
e17: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ ⟨ A , D ⟩ = ⟨ u , D ⟩ $ by opair_eq [e17b, e17c]
e18: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ c = ⟨ A , D ⟩ $ by weaken [#2]
e18a: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ c = ⟨ u , D ⟩ $ by eq_trans [e18, e17]
e18b: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ c = ⟨ u , u ⟩ $ by eq_trans [e18a, e16]
e19: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ ∃ y (c = ⟨ u , y ⟩) $ by ex_intro (x := $ y $, t := $ u $, p := $ c = ⟨ u , y ⟩ $) [e18b]
e20: $ G , ¬ isset D , u = A ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by ex_intro (x := $ x $, t := $ u $, p := $ ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $) [e19]
e21a: $ G , ¬ isset D ⇒ isset A $ by weaken [#1]
e21: $ G , ¬ isset D ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by isset_elim [e21a, e20]
e22: $ G ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (c = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by or_elim [e1, e14, e21]

tstep_rel
---------
r1: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ z ∊ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
r2: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by tstep_elim [r1]
r3: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
r4: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [r3]
r5: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
r6: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by t2_opair_ex [r5, r4]
r7: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by ax
r8: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by ex_elim [r7, r6]
r9: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩) $ by ex_elim [r2, r8]
r10: $ G ⇒ rel (tstep L F H) $ by rel_intro [r9]

tstep_cdm
---------
d1: $ G , a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) ⇒ a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) $ by ax
d2: $ G , a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ⟨ a , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
d3: $ G , a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) , ⟨ a , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by t2_tstep_fst [d2]
d4: $ G , a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by cdm_elim [d1, d3]
d5: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
d6: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k ∊ L $ by ax
d7: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
d8: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by tstep_mem [d6, d7]
d9: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
d10b: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ isset ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
d10: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ isset (fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩) $ by fv_set_c [d9, d10b]
d11: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
d12: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
d13: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ = v $ by eq_sym [d12]
d14: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ = a $ by eq_sym [d11]
d15: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ a , v ⟩ $ by opair_eq [d14, d13]
d16: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by weaken [d8]
d17: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by wcel_eq_l [d15, d16]
d18: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) , v = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) $ by cdm_intro [d17]
d19: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) , a = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ L , j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) $ by isset_elim [d10, d18]
d20: $ G , a ∊ L × fseq (cdm H) ⇒ a ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) $ by cxp_elim [d5, d19]
d21: $ G ⇒ cdm (tstep L F H) = L × fseq (cdm H) $ by eq_intro [d4, d20]

tstep_fv
--------
v1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by tstep_mem [#2, #3]
v2: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by opair_isset
v3a: $ G ⇒ isset ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
v3: $ G ⇒ isset (fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩) $ by fv_set_c [#1, v3a]
v4: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ $ by ax
v5: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
v6: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , s ⟩ = a $ by eq_sym [v4]
v7: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ = b $ by eq_sym [v5]
v8: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ a , b ⟩ $ by opair_eq [v6, v7]
v9a: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , s ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by weaken [v1]
v9: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ a , b ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by wcel_eq_l [v8, v9a]
v10: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ functional (tstep L F H) $ by tstep_functional
v11: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv (tstep L F H) a = b $ by fv_val [v10, v9]
v12a: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ (tstep L F H) = (tstep L F H) $ by eq_refl
v12: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv (tstep L F H) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv (tstep L F H) a $ by fv_eq [v12a, v6]
v13: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv (tstep L F H) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = b $ by eq_trans [v12, v11]
v14: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ , b = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ fv (tstep L F H) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [v13, v5]
v15a: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ isset (fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩) $ by weaken [v3]
v15: $ G , a = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ fv (tstep L F H) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ $ by isset_elim [v15a, v14]
v16: $ G ⇒ fv (tstep L F H) ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom H s ⟩ ⟩ $ by isset_elim [v2, v15]

tstep_set
---------
t1: $ G ⇒ isset (cdm H) $ by cdm_set [#3]
t2: $ G ⇒ isset (fseq (cdm H)) $ by fseq_set [t1]
t3: $ G ⇒ isset (L × fseq (cdm H)) $ by cxp_set [#2, t2]
t4: $ G ⇒ cdm (tstep L F H) = L × fseq (cdm H) $ by tstep_cdm [#1]
t5: $ G ⇒ L × fseq (cdm H) = cdm (tstep L F H) $ by eq_sym [t4]
t6: $ G ⇒ isset (cdm (tstep L F H)) $ by isset_eq [t5, t3]
t7: $ G ⇒ functional (tstep L F H) $ by tstep_functional
t8: $ G ⇒ isset (img (tstep L F H) (cdm (tstep L F H))) $ by img_set [t7, t6]
y1: $ G , y ∊ crn (tstep L F H) ⇒ y ∊ crn (tstep L F H) $ by ax
y2: $ G , y ∊ crn (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
y3: $ G , y ∊ crn (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ x ∊ cdm (tstep L F H) $ by cdm_intro [y2]
y4: $ G , y ∊ crn (tstep L F H) , ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F H) ⇒ y ∊ img (tstep L F H) (cdm (tstep L F H)) $ by img_intro [y3, y2]
y5: $ G , y ∊ crn (tstep L F H) ⇒ y ∊ img (tstep L F H) (cdm (tstep L F H)) $ by crn_elim [y1, y4]
t9: $ G ⇒ crn (tstep L F H) ⊆ img (tstep L F H) (cdm (tstep L F H)) $ by subset_intro [y5]
t10: $ G ⇒ isset (crn (tstep L F H)) $ by subset_isset [t8, t9]
t11: $ G ⇒ isset (cdm (tstep L F H) × crn (tstep L F H)) $ by cxp_set [t6, t10]
t12: $ G ⇒ rel (tstep L F H) $ by tstep_rel
t13: $ G ⇒ (tstep L F H) ⊆ cdm (tstep L F H) × crn (tstep L F H) $ by rel_subset_cxp [t12]
t14: $ G ⇒ isset (tstep L F H) $ by subset_isset [t11, t13]

tstep_mono
----------
m1: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ z ∊ (tstep L F H) $ by ax
m2: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by tstep_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
m4: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [m3]
m5: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by and_elim_r [m3]
m6: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k ∊ L $ by and_elim_l [m5]
m7: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by and_elim_r [m5]
m8: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ H ⊆ K $ by weaken [#2]
m9: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ cdm H ⊆ cdm K $ by cdm_mono [m8]
m10: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ fseq (cdm H) ⊆ fseq (cdm K) $ by fseq_mono [m9]
m11: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (cdm K) $ by subset_elim [m10, m7]
m12: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ crn j ⊆ cdm H $ by fseq_crn [m7]
m13: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ functional K $ by weaken [#1]
m14: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ccom H j = ccom K j $ by ccom_subset_eq [m13, m8, m12]
m15: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
m16: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ = ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m15, m14]
m17: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k = k $ by eq_refl
m18: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m17, m16]
m19: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ F = F $ by eq_refl
m20: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [m19, m18]
m21: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by eq_refl
m22: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m21, m20]
m23: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m4, m22]
m24: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ (tstep L F K) $ by tstep_mem [m6, m11]
m25: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [m23]
m26: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z ∈ (tstep L F K) $ by wcel_eq_l [m25, m24]
m27: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z ∊ (tstep L F K) $ by wcel_welc [m26]
m28: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by ax
m29: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) , ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ z ∊ (tstep L F K) $ by ex_elim [m28, m27]
m30: $ G , z ∊ (tstep L F H) ⇒ z ∊ (tstep L F K) $ by ex_elim [m2, m29]
m31: $ G ⇒ (tstep L F H) ⊆ (tstep L F K) $ by subset_intro [m30]

tstg_congr
----------
l1: $ ⋃ (crn g) ≐ ⋃ (crn g) $ by ceqt_refl
l2: $ tstep A C (⋃ (crn g)) ≐ tstep B D (⋃ (crn g)) $ by tstep_congr [#1, #2, l1]
l3: $ cgr g (tstep A C (⋃ (crn g))) ≐ cgr g (tstep B D (⋃ (crn g))) $ by cgr_congr [l2]
l4: $ trec (cgr g (tstep A C (⋃ (crn g)))) ≐ trec (cgr g (tstep B D (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by trec_congr [l3]

sb_c_tstg
---------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (trec (cgr g (tstep A B (⋃ (crn g)))))) ≐ trec (cgr g (tstep (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by ceqt_refl

tstgb_congr
-----------
l1: $ tstg A C ≐ tstg B D $ by tstg_congr [#1, #2]
l2: $ cres (tstg A C) E ≐ cres (tstg B D) F $ by cres_congr [l1, #3]
l3: $ crn (cres (tstg A C) E) ≐ crn (cres (tstg B D) F) $ by crn_congr [l2]
l4: $ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg A C) E)) ≐ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg B D) F)) $ by cuni_congr [l3]

sb_c_tstgb
----------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (⋃ (crn (cres (tstg A B) C)))) ≐ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) (⟦ x / t ⟧ C))) $ by ceqt_refl

tstg_functional
---------------
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (trec (cgr g (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g))))) $ by trec_functional

tstg_set
--------
l1: $ G ⇒ functional (tstg L F) $ by tstg_functional
l2: $ G ⇒ isset (fv (tstg L F) a) $ by fv_set [l1]

tstgb_intro
-----------
s1: $ G ⇒ isset (fv (tstg L F) b) $ by tstg_set
s2: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ j = (fv (tstg L F) b) $ by ax
s3: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ (fv (tstg L F) b) = j $ by eq_sym [s2]
s4: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ c ∊ (fv (tstg L F) b) $ by weaken [#3]
s5: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ c ∊ j $ by welc_eq [s3, s4]
s6: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ ord a $ by weaken [#1]
s7: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ b ∊ a $ by weaken [#2]
s8: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ ord b $ by ord_elem [s6, s7]
s9a: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ functional (cgr g (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by cgr_functional
s9: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ b ∊ cdm (trec (cgr g (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g))))) $ by trec_cdm [s9a, s8]
s10: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ functional (tstg L F) $ by tstg_functional
s11: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ ⟨ b , (fv (tstg L F) b) ⟩ ∈ tstg L F $ by fv_in [s10, s9]
s12: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ b = b $ by eq_refl
s13: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ ⟨ b , (fv (tstg L F) b) ⟩ = ⟨ b , j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [s12, s3]
s14: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ ⟨ b , j ⟩ ∈ tstg L F $ by wcel_eq_l [s13, s11]
s15: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ ⟨ b , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a $ by cres_intro [s7, s14]
s16: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) $ by crn_intro [s15]
s17: $ G , j = (fv (tstg L F) b) ⇒ c ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) a)) $ by cuni_intro [s5, s16]
s18: $ G ⇒ c ∊ tstgb L F a $ by isset_elim [s1, s17]

tstgb_elim
----------
e1: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a $ by ax
e2: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ i ∊ a ∧ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ tstg L F $ by cres_elim [e1]
e3: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ i ∊ a $ by and_elim_l [e2]
e4: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ tstg L F $ by and_elim_r [e2]
e5: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ functional (tstg L F) $ by tstg_functional
e6: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ fv (tstg L F) i = j $ by fv_val [e5, e4]
e7: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ j = fv (tstg L F) i $ by eq_sym [e6]
e8: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ c ∊ j $ by ax
e9: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) i $ by welc_eq [e7, e8]
e10: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ i ∊ a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) i $ by and_intro [e3, e9]
e11: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) a ⇒ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) b) $ by ex_intro [e10]
e12: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j ⇒ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) $ by ax
e13: $ G , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) a) , c ∊ j ⇒ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) b) $ by crn_elim [e12, e11]
e14: $ G ⇒ c ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) a)) $ by weaken [#1]
e15: $ G ⇒ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) b) $ by cuni_elim [e14, e13]

--| `tstep` respects equality of its function argument in a context.
lemma t2_tstep_sub (G: hyps) (L F H K: class): $ G ⇒ H = K $ > $ G ⇒ tstep L F H ⊆ tstep L F K $
----
m1: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H ⇒ z ∊ tstep L F H $ by ax
m2: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H ⇒ ∃ k ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by tstep_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by ax
m4: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [m3]
m5: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by and_elim_r [m3]
m6: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k ∊ L $ by and_elim_l [m5]
m7: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) $ by and_elim_r [m5]
m8: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ H = K $ by weaken [#1]
m9: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ cdm H = cdm K $ by cdm_eq [m8]
m10: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ fseq (cdm H) = fseq (cdm K) $ by fseq_eq [m9]
m11: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (cdm K) $ by welc_eq [m10, m7]
m15: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ j = j $ by eq_refl
m14: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ccom H j = ccom K j $ by ccom_eq [m8, m15]
m16: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ = ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m15, m14]
m17: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ k = k $ by eq_refl
m18: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m17, m16]
m19: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ F = F $ by eq_refl
m20: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [m19, m18]
m21: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by eq_refl
m22: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [m21, m20]
m23: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [m4, m22]
m24: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tstep L F K $ by tstep_mem [m6, m11]
m25: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom K j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [m23]
m26: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z ∈ tstep L F K $ by wcel_eq_l [m25, m24]
m27: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H) ⇒ z ∊ tstep L F K $ by wcel_welc [m26]
m28: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) $ by ax
m29: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H , ∃ j (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , j ⟩ , fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ j , ccom H j ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ L ∧ j ∊ fseq (cdm H)) ⇒ z ∊ tstep L F K $ by ex_elim [m28, m27]
m30: $ G , z ∊ tstep L F H ⇒ z ∊ tstep L F K $ by ex_elim [m2, m29]
m31: $ G ⇒ tstep L F H ⊆ tstep L F K $ by subset_intro [m30]

tstep_eq_arg
------------
q1: $ G ⇒ tstep L F H ⊆ tstep L F K $ by t2_tstep_sub [#1]
q2: $ G ⇒ K = H $ by eq_sym [#1]
q3: $ G ⇒ tstep L F K ⊆ tstep L F H $ by t2_tstep_sub [q2]
q4: $ G ⇒ tstep L F H = tstep L F K $ by subset_antisym [q1, q3]

lemma t2_fv_cgr_tstep {g: set} (G: hyps) (L F: class) (i: set): $ G ⇒ isset (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ > $ G ⇒ fv (cgr g (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g)))) i = (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g)))) $
----
c1: $ G ⇒ fv (cgr g (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g)))) i = (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep L F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by fv_cgr [#1]

tstg_eq
-------
q1: $ G ⇒ functional (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by cgr_functional
q2: $ G ⇒ fv (trec (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g))))) a = fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) (cres (trec (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g))))) a) $ by trec_eq [q1, #2]
q3: $ G ⇒ cres (trec (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g))))) a ∈ trapx (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by trec_cres_apx [q1, #2]
q4: $ G ⇒ isset (cres (tstg l F) a) $ by wcel_isset [q3]
q5: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ i = (cres (tstg l F) a) $ by ax
q6: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (cres (tstg l F) a) = i $ by eq_sym [q5]
q7: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) = (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by eq_refl
q8: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) (cres (tstg l F) a) = fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) i $ by fv_eq [q7, q6]
q9: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ isset i $ by isset_var
q10: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ isset (crn i) $ by crn_set [q9]
q11: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ isset (⋃ (crn i)) $ by cuni_set [q10]
q12: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
q12b: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ isset l $ by isset_var
q13: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ isset (tstep l F (⋃ (crn i))) $ by tstep_set [q12, q12b, q11]
x1: $ (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) ≐ tstep l F (⋃ (crn i)) $ by ceqt_refl
x2: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) = tstep l F (⋃ (crn i)) $ by weaken [x1]
x3: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ tstep l F (⋃ (crn i)) = (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by eq_sym [x2]
x4: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ isset (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by isset_eq [x3, q13]
q14a: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) i = (⟦ g / i ⟧ (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by t2_fv_cgr_tstep [x4]
q14: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) i = tstep l F (⋃ (crn i)) $ by eq_trans [q14a, x2]
q15: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ crn i = crn (cres (tstg l F) a) $ by crn_eq [q5]
q16: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ ⋃ (crn i) = ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg l F) a)) $ by cuni_eq [q15]
q17: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ tstep l F (⋃ (crn i)) = tstep l F (⋃ (crn (cres (tstg l F) a))) $ by tstep_eq_arg [q16]
q18: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (fv (tstg l F) a) = fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) (cres (tstg l F) a) $ by weaken [q2]
q19: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (fv (tstg l F) a) = fv (cgr g (tstep l F (⋃ (crn g)))) i $ by eq_trans [q18, q8]
q20: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (fv (tstg l F) a) = tstep l F (⋃ (crn i)) $ by eq_trans [q19, q14]
q21: $ G , i = (cres (tstg l F) a) ⇒ (fv (tstg l F) a) = tstep l F (⋃ (crn (cres (tstg l F) a))) $ by eq_trans [q20, q17]
q22: $ G ⇒ (fv (tstg l F) a) = tstep l F (tstgb l F a) $ by isset_elim [q4, q21]

tstg_val_functional
-------------------
l1: $ G ⇒ (fv (tstg l F) a) = tstep l F (tstgb l F a) $ by tstg_eq [#1, #2]
l2: $ G ⇒ tstep l F (tstgb l F a) = (fv (tstg l F) a) $ by eq_sym [l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ functional (tstep l F (tstgb l F a)) $ by tstep_functional
l4: $ G ⇒ functional (fv (tstg l F) a) $ by functional_eq [l2, l3]

tstgb_mono
----------
m1: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C $ by ax
m2: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ i ∊ C ∧ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ (tstg L F) $ by cres_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ i ∊ C $ by and_elim_l [m2]
m4: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ (tstg L F) $ by and_elim_r [m2]
m5: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ C ⊆ D $ by weaken [#1]
m6: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ i ∊ D $ by subset_elim [m5, m3]
m7: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) D $ by cres_intro [m6, m4]
m8: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) D) $ by crn_intro [m7]
m9: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ w ∊ j $ by ax
m10: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) C ⇒ w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) D)) $ by cuni_intro [m9, m8]
m11: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j ⇒ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) $ by ax
m12: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) , j ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) C) , w ∊ j ⇒ w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) D)) $ by crn_elim [m11, m10]
m13: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) ⇒ w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) $ by ax
m14: $ G , w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) ⇒ w ∊ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) D)) $ by cuni_elim [m13, m12]
m15: $ G ⇒ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) C)) ⊆ ⋃ (crn (cres (tstg L F) D)) $ by subset_intro [m14]

--| An element of the range of the stages below `u` is the stage at an element of `u`.
lemma t2_rn_ex {c: set} (G: hyps) (L F: class) (u i: set): $ G ⇒ i ∊ crn (cres (tstg L F) u) $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ c (c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg L F) c) $
----
r1: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u $ by ax
r2: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ a ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ tstg L F $ by cres_elim [r1]
r3: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ a ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [r2]
r4: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ tstg L F $ by and_elim_r [r2]
r5: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ functional (tstg L F) $ by tstg_functional
r6: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ fv (tstg L F) a = i $ by fv_val [r5, r4]
r7: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ i = fv (tstg L F) a $ by eq_sym [r6]
r8: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ a ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg L F) a $ by and_intro [r3, r7]
r9: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg L F) u ⇒ ∃ c (c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg L F) c) $ by ex_intro (x := $ c $, t := $ a $, p := $ c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg L F) c $) [r8]
r10: $ G ⇒ ∃ c (c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg L F) c) $ by crn_elim [#1, r9]

lemma t2_rn_val_functional (G: hyps) (F: class) (l u i: set): $ G ⇒ functional F $ > $ G ⇒ ord u $ > $ G ⇒ i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) $ > $ G ⇒ functional i $
----
r1: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u $ by ax
r2: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ a ∊ u ∧ ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ tstg l F $ by cres_elim [r1]
r3: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ a ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [r2]
r4: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ tstg l F $ by and_elim_r [r2]
r5: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ functional (tstg l F) $ by tstg_functional
r6: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ fv (tstg l F) a = i $ by fv_val [r5, r4]
r7: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ ord u $ by weaken [#2]
r8: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ ord a $ by ord_elem [r7, r3]
r9: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
r10: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ functional (fv (tstg l F) a) $ by tstg_val_functional [r9, r8]
r11: $ G , ⟨ a , i ⟩ ∈ cres (tstg l F) u ⇒ functional i $ by functional_eq [r6, r10]
r12: $ G ⇒ functional i $ by crn_elim [#3, r11]

tstg_val_chain
--------------
a1: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) $ by ax
a2: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ functional F $ by weaken [#1]
a3: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ ord u $ by ax
a4: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ functional i $ by t2_rn_val_functional [a2, a3, a1]
a5: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u ⇒ i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) → functional i $ by imp_intro [a4]
a6: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) → functional i) $ by all_intro [a5]
b1: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) $ by ax
b2: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) $ by and_elim_l [b1]
b3: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b4: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ ∃ c (c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c) $ by t2_rn_ex [b2]
b5: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ⇒ ∃ f (f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f) $ by t2_rn_ex [b3]
b6: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c $ by ax
b7: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ c ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [b6]
b8: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ i = fv (tstg l F) c $ by and_elim_r [b6]
b9: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f $ by ax
b10: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ f ∊ u $ by and_elim_l [b9]
b11: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ j = fv (tstg l F) f $ by and_elim_r [b9]
b12: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ ord u $ by ax
b13: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ ord c $ by ord_elem [b12, b7]
b14: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ ord f $ by ord_elem [b12, b10]
b15: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → ∀ v (ord v → v ⊆ y → fv (tstg l F) v ⊆ fv (tstg l F) y)) , ord w , w ⊆ u , i ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) ∧ j ∊ crn (cres (tstg l F) u) , c ∊ u ∧ i = fv (tstg l F) c , f ∊ u ∧ j = fv (tstg l F) f ⇒ c ⊆ f ∨ f ⊆ c $ by ord_subset_or [b13, b14]
