s13: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ l × fseq c = l × fseq (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) $ by cxp_eq [s12b, s12]
s14: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = l × fseq (cdm (tstgb l F u)) $ by eq_trans [s3, s4]
s15: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = l × fseq (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) $ by eq_trans [s14, s8]
s16: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = l × fseq (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) $ by weaken [s15]
s17: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ l × fseq (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) = l × fseq c $ by eq_sym [s13]
s18: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = l × fseq c $ by eq_trans [s16, s17]
s19: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ l × fseq c = cap x (l × fseq x) (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) $ by eq_sym [s11]
s20: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = cap x (l × fseq x) (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) $ by eq_trans [s18, s19]
s21a: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) u = cap x (l × fseq x) (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) $ by weaken [s9]
s21: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ cap x (l × fseq x) (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) u $ by eq_sym [s21a]
s22: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) , c = (stgb x (l × fseq x) u) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) u $ by eq_trans [s20, s21]
s23: $ G , ord u , ∀ y (y ∊ u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) y) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) y) ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) u $ by isset_elim [s10, s22]
s24: $ G ⇒ ∀ u (ord u → cdm (fv (tstg l F) u) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) u) $ by ord_ind_f [s23]
s25: $ G ⇒ ord a → cdm (fv (tstg l F) a) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) a $ by all_elim (t := $ a $) [s24]
s26: $ G ⇒ cdm (fv (tstg l F) a) = fv (stg x (l × fseq x)) a $ by imp_elim [s25, #2]

trc_congr
---------
d1: $ tstg A C ≐ tstg B D $ by tstg_congr [#1, #2]
d2: $ a ≐ a $ by ceqt_refl
d3: $ fv (tstg A C) a ≐ fv (tstg B D) a $ by fv_congr [d1, d2]
d4: $ seqt z z $ by seqt_refl
d5: $ (z ∊ fv (tstg A C) a) ⟺ (z ∊ fv (tstg B D) a) $ by welc_congr [d4, d3]
d6: $ ord a ⟺ ord a $ by iff_refl
d7: $ (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A C) a) ⟺ (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg B D) a) $ by and_congr [d6, d5]
d8: $ (∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A C) a)) ⟺ ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg B D) a) $ by ex_congr [d7]
d9: $ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A C) a)} ≐ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg B D) a)} $ by cab_congr [d8]

lemma t3_tstep_sub (G: hyps) (A B C D E: class) (z: set):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ tstep A C E $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ tstep B D E $
----
t1: $ G ⇒ ∃ k ∃ i (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E)) $ by tstep_elim [#3]
t2: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) $ by ax
t3: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [t2]
t4: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) $ by and_elim_r [t2]
t5: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ k ∊ A $ by and_elim_l [t4]
t6: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) $ by and_elim_r [t4]
t7: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ A = B $ by weaken [#1]
t8: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ k ∊ B $ by welc_eq [t7, t5]
t9: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv D ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ tstep B D E $ by tstep_mem [t8, t6]
t10: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ C = D $ by weaken [#2]
t11: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_refl
t12: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ = fv D ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ $ by fv_eq [t10, t11]
t13: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ ⟨ k , i ⟩ = ⟨ k , i ⟩ $ by eq_refl
t14: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv D ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [t13, t12]
t15: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv D ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [t3, t14]
t16: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv D ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = z $ by eq_sym [t15]
t17: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ z ∈ tstep B D E $ by wcel_eq_l [t16, t9]
t18: $ G , z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E) ⇒ z ∊ tstep B D E $ by wcel_welc [t17]
t19: $ G , ∃ i (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E)) ⇒ ∃ i (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E)) $ by ax
t20: $ G , ∃ i (z = ⟨ ⟨ k , i ⟩ , fv C ⟨ k , ⟨ i , ccom E i ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ k ∊ A ∧ i ∊ fseq (cdm E)) ⇒ z ∊ tstep B D E $ by ex_elim [t19, t18]
t21: $ G ⇒ z ∊ tstep B D E $ by ex_elim [t1, t20]

lemma t3_tstep_eq (G: hyps) (A B C D E: class):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G ⇒ tstep A C E = tstep B D E $
----
q1: $ G , z ∊ tstep A C E ⇒ z ∊ tstep A C E $ by ax
q2: $ G , z ∊ tstep A C E ⇒ A = B $ by weaken [#1]
q3: $ G , z ∊ tstep A C E ⇒ C = D $ by weaken [#2]
q4: $ G , z ∊ tstep A C E ⇒ z ∊ tstep B D E $ by t3_tstep_sub [q2, q3, q1]
q5: $ G ⇒ B = A $ by eq_sym [#1]
q6: $ G ⇒ D = C $ by eq_sym [#2]
q7: $ G , z ∊ tstep B D E ⇒ z ∊ tstep B D E $ by ax
q8: $ G , z ∊ tstep B D E ⇒ B = A $ by weaken [q5]
q9: $ G , z ∊ tstep B D E ⇒ D = C $ by weaken [q6]
q10: $ G , z ∊ tstep B D E ⇒ z ∊ tstep A C E $ by t3_tstep_sub [q8, q9, q7]
q11: $ G ⇒ tstep A C E = tstep B D E $ by eq_intro [q4, q10]

lemma t3_tstg_eq (G: hyps) (A B C D: class):
  $ G ⇒ A = B $ > $ G ⇒ C = D $ > $ G ⇒ tstg A C = tstg B D $
----
e1: $ G ⇒ tstep A C (⋃ (crn g)) = tstep B D (⋃ (crn g)) $ by t3_tstep_eq [#1, #2]
e2: $ G ⇒ ∀ g (tstep A C (⋃ (crn g)) = tstep B D (⋃ (crn g))) $ by all_intro [e1]
e3: $ G ⇒ cgr g (tstep A C (⋃ (crn g))) = cgr g (tstep B D (⋃ (crn g))) $ by cgr_eq [e2]
e4: $ G ⇒ trec (cgr g (tstep A C (⋃ (crn g)))) = trec (cgr g (tstep B D (⋃ (crn g)))) $ by trec_eq_cong [e3]

lemma t3_trc_sub (G: hyps) (A B C D: class) (c: set):
  $ G ⇒ tstg A C = tstg B D $ > $ G ⇒ c ∊ trc A C $ > $ G ⇒ c ∊ trc B D $
----
c1: $ G ⇒ ∃ a (ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a) $ by cab_elim (x := $ z $, t := $ c $, p := $ ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A C) a) $) [#2]
c2: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a $ by ax
c3: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ ord a $ by and_elim_l [c2]
c4: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a $ by and_elim_r [c2]
c5: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ tstg A C = tstg B D $ by weaken [#1]
c6: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
c7: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ fv (tstg A C) a = fv (tstg B D) a $ by fv_eq [c5, c6]
c8: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ c ∊ fv (tstg B D) a $ by welc_eq [c7, c4]
c9: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg B D) a $ by and_intro [c3, c8]
c10: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ ∃ a (ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg B D) a) $ by ex_intro (x := $ a $, t := $ a $, p := $ ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg B D) a $) [c9]
c11: $ G , ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg A C) a ⇒ c ∊ trc B D $ by cab_intro (x := $ z $, t := $ c $, p := $ ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg B D) a) $) [c10]
c12: $ G ⇒ c ∊ trc B D $ by ex_elim [c1, c11]

trc_eq
------
f1: $ G ⇒ tstg A C = tstg B D $ by t3_tstg_eq [#1, #2]
f2: $ G , c ∊ trc A C ⇒ c ∊ trc A C $ by ax
f3: $ G , c ∊ trc A C ⇒ tstg A C = tstg B D $ by weaken [f1]
f4: $ G , c ∊ trc A C ⇒ c ∊ trc B D $ by t3_trc_sub [f3, f2]
f5: $ G ⇒ tstg B D = tstg A C $ by eq_sym [f1]
f6: $ G , c ∊ trc B D ⇒ c ∊ trc B D $ by ax
f7: $ G , c ∊ trc B D ⇒ tstg B D = tstg A C $ by weaken [f5]
f8: $ G , c ∊ trc B D ⇒ c ∊ trc A C $ by t3_trc_sub [f7, f6]
f9: $ G ⇒ trc A C = trc B D $ by eq_intro [f4, f8]

sb_c_trc
--------
l1: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)}) ≐ {z | [x/t] (∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a))} $ by sb_c_cab
l2: $ [x/t] (∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)) ⟺ ∃ a ([x/t] (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)) $ by sb_f_ex
l3: $ [x/t] (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a) ⟺ ([x/t] (ord a) ∧ [x/t] (z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)) $ by sb_f_and
l4: $ [x/t] (ord a) ⟺ ord (⟦ x / t ⟧ a) $ by sb_f_ord
l5: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ a) ≐ a $ by sb_c_other
l6: $ ord (⟦ x / t ⟧ a) ⟺ ord a $ by ord_congr [l5]
l7: $ [x/t] (z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a) ⟺ z ∊ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (fv (tstg A B) a)) $ by sb_f_welc_other
l8: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (fv (tstg A B) a)) ≐ fv (⟦ x / t ⟧ (tstg A B)) (⟦ x / t ⟧ a) $ by sb_c_fv
l9: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (tstg A B)) ≐ tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B) $ by sb_c_tstg
l10: $ fv (⟦ x / t ⟧ (tstg A B)) (⟦ x / t ⟧ a) ≐ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a $ by fv_congr [l9, l5]
l11: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (fv (tstg A B) a)) ≐ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a $ by ceqt_trans [l8, l10]
l12: $ seqt z z $ by seqt_refl
l13: $ (z ∊ (⟦ x / t ⟧ (fv (tstg A B) a))) ⟺ (z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a) $ by welc_congr [l12, l11]
l14: $ [x/t] (z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a) ⟺ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a $ by iff_trans [l7, l13]
l15: $ [x/t] (ord a) ⟺ ord a $ by iff_trans [l4, l6]
l16: $ ([x/t] (ord a) ∧ [x/t] (z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)) ⟺ (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a) $ by and_congr [l15, l14]
l17: $ [x/t] (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a) ⟺ (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a) $ by iff_trans [l3, l16]
l18: $ (∃ a ([x/t] (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a))) ⟺ ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a) $ by ex_congr [l17]
l19: $ [x/t] (∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)) ⟺ ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a) $ by iff_trans [l2, l18]
l20: $ {z | [x/t] (∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a))} ≐ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a)} $ by cab_congr [l19]
l21: $ (⟦ x / t ⟧ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg A B) a)}) ≐ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg (⟦ x / t ⟧ A) (⟦ x / t ⟧ B)) a)} $ by ceqt_trans [l1, l20]

trc_intro
---------
l1: $ G ⇒ ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) a $ by and_intro [#1, #2]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ w (ord w ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) w) $ by ex_intro (x := $ w $, t := $ a $, p := $ ord w ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) w $) [l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ c ∊ {z | ∃ w (ord w ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg L F) w)} $ by cab_intro (x := $ z $, t := $ c $, p := $ ∃ w (ord w ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg L F) w) $) [l2]

trc_elim
--------
l1: $ G ⇒ c ∊ {z | ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg L F) a)} $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∃ a (ord a ∧ c ∊ fv (tstg L F) a) $ by cab_elim (x := $ z $, t := $ c $, p := $ ∃ a (ord a ∧ z ∊ fv (tstg L F) a) $) [l1]

tstg_subset_trc
---------------
l1: $ G , z ∊ fv (tstg L F) a ⇒ ord a $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , z ∊ fv (tstg L F) a ⇒ z ∊ fv (tstg L F) a $ by ax
l3: $ G , z ∊ fv (tstg L F) a ⇒ z ∊ trc L F $ by trc_intro [l1, l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ fv (tstg L F) a ⊆ trc L F $ by subset_intro [l3]

lemma t3_trc_pair_elim {a: set} (G: hyps a) (H: hyps) (L F: class) (i j: set) (c: fml):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ trc L F $ > $ H , ord a , ⟨ i , j ⟩ ∈ fv (tstg L F) a ⇒ c $ > $ G , H ⇒ c $
----
p1: $ H , w = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ trc L F ⇒ w ∊ trc L F $ by ax
p2: $ H , w = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ trc L F ⇒ ∃ a (ord a ∧ w ∊ fv (tstg L F) a) $ by trc_elim [p1]
p3: $ H , w = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ trc L F , ord a ∧ w ∊ fv (tstg L F) a ⇒ ord a ∧ w ∊ fv (tstg L F) a $ by ax
p4: $ H , w = ⟨ i , j ⟩ , w ∊ trc L F , ord a ∧ w ∊ fv (tstg L F) a ⇒ ord a $ by and_elim_l [p3]
