r14a: $ G , w = ω , g = clord w , j = suc g , u = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ k = k $ by eq_refl
r14: $ G , w = ω , g = clord w , j = suc g , u = ⟨ k , s ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom (tstgb l F j) s ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom (trc l F) s ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [r14a, r13]
