lemma t3_ccom_sub (G: hyps) {y: set} (H K: class) (f a c: set):
  $ G ⇒ functional H $ > $ G ⇒ functional K $ > $ G ⇒ crn f ⊆ cdm K $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ crn f → fv H y = fv K y) $ > $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom K f $
----
w1: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f $ by ax
w2: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f $ by ax
w3: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H $ by ax
w4: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ v ∊ crn f $ by crn_intro [w2]
w5: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ crn f → fv H y = fv K y) $ by weaken [#4]
w6: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ v ∊ crn f → fv H v = fv K v $ by all_elim (t := $ v $) [w5]
w7: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ fv H v = fv K v $ by imp_elim [w6, w4]
w8: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ functional H $ by weaken [#1]
w9: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ fv H v = c $ by fv_val [w8, w3]
w10: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ fv K v = fv H v $ by eq_sym [w7]
w11: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ fv K v = c $ by eq_trans [w10, w9]
w12: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ crn f ⊆ cdm K $ by weaken [#3]
w13: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ v ∊ cdm K $ by subset_elim [w12, w4]
w14: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ functional K $ by weaken [#2]
w15: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ v , fv K v ⟩ ∈ K $ by fv_in [w14, w13]
w16: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ v = v $ by eq_refl
w17: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ v , fv K v ⟩ = ⟨ v , c ⟩ $ by opair_eq [w16, w11]
w18: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ K $ by wcel_eq_l [w17, w15]
w19: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f , ⟨ a , v ⟩ ∈ f , ⟨ v , c ⟩ ∈ H ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom K f $ by ccom_intro [w2, w18]
w20: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom K f $ by ccom_elim [w1, w19]

