------------
x1: $ G ⇒ rel (ccom H f) $ by ccom_rel
x2: $ G ⇒ rel (ccom K f) $ by ccom_rel
x3: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom K f $ by t3_ccom_sub [#1, #2, #4, #5]
