x6: $ G , y ∊ crn f ⇒ y ∊ crn f $ by ax
x7: $ G , y ∊ crn f ⇒ fv H y = fv K y $ by imp_elim [x5, x6]
x8: $ G , y ∊ crn f ⇒ fv K y = fv H y $ by eq_sym [x7]
x9: $ G ⇒ y ∊ crn f → fv K y = fv H y $ by imp_intro [x8]
x10: $ G ⇒ ∀ y (y ∊ crn f → fv K y = fv H y) $ by all_intro [x9]
x11: $ G , ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom K f ⇒ ⟨ a , c ⟩ ∈ ccom H f $ by t3_ccom_sub [#2, #1, #3, x10]
x12: $ G ⇒ ccom H f = ccom K f $ by rel_eq_intro [x1, x2, x3, x11]

