u3: $ G , k ∊ l , s ∊ fseq (trees l) , crn s ⊆ {z | fv h z = fv (trc l F) z} ⇒ k ∊ l → s ∊ fseq (trees l) → fv h ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom h s ⟩ ⟩ $ by all_elim (t := $ s $) [u2]
