u6: $ G , k ∊ l , s ∊ fseq (trees l) , crn s ⊆ {z | fv h z = fv (trc l F) z} ⇒ s ∊ fseq (trees l) → fv h ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom h s ⟩ ⟩ $ by imp_elim [u3, u4]
u7: $ G , k ∊ l , s ∊ fseq (trees l) , crn s ⊆ {z | fv h z = fv (trc l F) z} ⇒ fv h ⟨ k , s ⟩ = fv F ⟨ k , ⟨ s , ccom h s ⟩ ⟩ $ by imp_elim [u6, u5]
